      "refersTo": "nav-active",
      "description": "桌面导航的当前项、悬停与键盘焦点。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#home\">首页</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item ds-current\" href=\"#products\" aria-current=\"page\">农产品集市</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#experts\">农业专家</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:28px;background:var(--surface,#fff);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;font-size:14px;}.ds-nav-item{padding:32px 0 29px;color:var(--muted,#626e66);border-bottom:2px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none}.ds-nav-item.ds-current{color:var(--accent,#216448);border-bottom-color:var(--accent,#216448)}.ds-nav-item:hover{color:var(--accent,#216448)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6b997b;outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "状态标签",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-primary",
      "description": "静态状态，不伪装为操作。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">已通过</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:24px;padding:0 9px;border:1px solid var(--el-color-primary-light-8,#d6e5d9);border-radius:4px;background:var(--el-color-primary-light-9,#edf4ef);color:var(--accent,#216448);font-weight:500;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1;white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "商品卡片",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "product-card",
      "description": "展示既有图片缺失状态；不引入远程图片或虚构销量。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-product\" href=\"#product\"><div class=\"ds-cover\">商品分类 · 暂无图片</div><div class=\"ds-product-body\"><h3 class=\"ds-product-name\">商品名称</h3><span class=\"ds-product-source\">查看农户信息</span></div></a>",
      "css": ".ds-product{display:block;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line,#dfe5df);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#202f27);text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .18s;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;font-size:14px;}.ds-product:hover{border-color:#93b29b}.ds-product:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6b997b;outline-offset:4px;}.ds-cover{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:#eaf0e7;color:var(--muted,#626e66);font-size:12px}.ds-product-body{padding:18px}.ds-product-name{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-product-source{display:block;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dfe5df);padding-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#626e66)}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-product-body{padding:13px}.ds-product-name{font-size:14px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-product{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "三人联保席位",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "group-seat-filled",
      "description": "已有人与待加入席位的真实外观，示例用中性说明。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seats\" aria-label=\"成员席位示例\"><span class=\"ds-seat ds-filled\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M512 512a192 192 0 1 0 0-384 192 192 0 0 0 0 384m0 64a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 0 1 0 512m320 320v-96a96 96 0 0 0-96-96H288a96 96 0 0 0-96 96v96a32 32 0 1 1-64 0v-96a160 160 0 0 1 160-160h448a160 160 0 0 1 160 160v96a32 32 0 1 1-64 0\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"ds-seat\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M480 480V128a32 32 0 0 1 64 0v352h352a32 32 0 1 1 0 64H544v352a32 32 0 1 1-64 0V544H128a32 32 0 0 1 0-64z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"ds-seat\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M480 480V128a32 32 0 0 1 64 0v352h352a32 32 0 1 1 0 64H544v352a32 32 0 1 1-64 0V544H128a32 32 0 0 1 0-64z\"></path></svg></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seats{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;font-size:14px;}.ds-seat{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border:1px dashed #a9baaa;border-radius:50%;color:var(--muted,#626e66);font-size:14px}.ds-seat.ds-filled{border:1px solid #cadbcb;background:var(--accent-soft,#e7f0e8);color:var(--accent,#216448)}.ds-seat svg{width:14px;height:14px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "品牌字标",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "项目既有苗芽与田垄 SVG，带中文副标题。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-brand\" href=\"#home\" aria-label=\"融销通首页\"><svg class=\"ds-brand-symbol\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 34V12M20 22C11 22 7 17 7 10c8 0 13 4 13 12Zm0-6C20 8 25 4 33 4c0 8-5 12-13 12Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M7 30c8-5 18-5 26 0M5 36c10-5 20-5 30 0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-wordmark\">融销通<span class=\"ds-caption\">农业融销服务平台</span></span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--accent,#216448);text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif}.ds-brand-symbol{width:38px;height:38px}.ds-wordmark{font-size:23px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:.03em;color:var(--ink,#202f27)}.ds-caption{display:block;margin-top:5px;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--muted,#626e66)}.ds-brand:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6b997b;outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-brand-symbol{width:32px;height:32px}.ds-wordmark{font-size:21px}.ds-caption{font-size:10px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "图标按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon",
      "description": "现有购物车图标按钮，沿用Element Plus SVG。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-icon-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"购物车\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M432 928a48 48 0 1 1 0-96 48 48 0 0 1 0 96m320 0a48 48 0 1 1 0-96 48 48 0 0 1 0 96M96 128a32 32 0 0 1 0-64h160a32 32 0 0 1 31.36 25.728L320.64 256H928a32 32 0 0 1 31.296 38.72l-96 448A32 32 0 0 1 832 768H384a32 32 0 0 1-31.36-25.728L229.76 128zm314.24 576h395.904l82.304-384H333.44z\"></path></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-icon-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:40px;min-height:40px;padding:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#202f27);border:0;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}.ds-icon-button svg{width:20px;height:20px}.ds-icon-button:hover{background:var(--surface-soft,#eef3ee)}.ds-icon-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6b997b;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-icon-button{min-width:44px;min-height:44px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "现代农业门户与专业浅色工作台",
    "overview": "以农业绿色连接农产品交易、三人联保和专家服务。门户以田野摄影、商品内容和中文衬线标题建立农业识别；业务工作台用浅中性色、清晰的系统中文正文、细分隔和状态文字支持办理任务。\n\n同一品牌覆盖公共门户、个人业务、银行和平台管理。页面密度按任务调整：门户给内容留白，表格与表单保持可扫描的结构；绿色集中用于品牌、主操作、当前导航和正常状态，待处理与拒绝各有语义颜色。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "农业绿色、白色与浅中性色构成共同基底。",
      "门户标题用中文衬线，业务文字用系统中文无衬线。",
      "平面卡片与细边界组织内容，深度主要来自色面和留白。",
      "三人联保用真实成员席位表达成组条件。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Green Rule",
        "body": "绿色承接品牌、当前操作和正常状态；待处理与拒绝保留独立语义和文字，不用绿色填满整个工作台。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Card Rule",
        "body": "卡片靠边界、间距和内容建立层级；悬停改变边界，不把业务卡片变成悬浮面板。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 复用前置 tokens 和现有 Element Plus 主题；同名 CSS 变量是运行时来源。",
      "Do 让主操作、状态和辅助说明保持层级；金额和数量使用等宽数字。",
      "Do 沿用手机单列、工作台抽屉和表格容器内滚动，并分别检查长标题、数量控件和操作区域。",
      "Do 为加载、空结果和失败分别呈现反馈；错误提供实际重试入口。",
      "Do 保留摄影署名、许可入口和演示素材说明。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 使用大面积高饱和背景或装饰渐变替代已确认的浅色农业品牌。",
      "Don't 将门户的不对称照片圆角、衬线标题或入口动效铺到业务表格与全部卡片。",
      "Don't 用随机人物评价、虚构审批事件、实际放款或平台业绩填充画面。",
      "Don't 将照片所示产地表述为平台实际经营范围；不要移除演示金融说明。",
      "Don't 为新页面加载未经确认的中文 Web 字体，或声称不同系统的字体和字重完全一致。"
    ]
  }
}
